BEGIN_DESC
OrbiterCrew: the jet pack lies two metres in front of her on the Moon. Walk up (W), press B to put it on.
Numpad 0 / . hover thrust, numpad attitude (the pods tilt), J hover hold (Ins/Del), C auto descent, G booms, B to take it off.
W/S move, A/D turn, Q/E side step, Shift run, Space jump, K suit. Press H for the crew HUD in the cockpit view (F1).
END_DESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 58710.6
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship NizaKrit
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
